<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.capture.pours ~ capture conversation transcripts into a sensorium

One pointer (`surface` with `pointer`) captures that transcript; `bulk` captures or recaptures every local operator-AI transcript in one pass (`surface` all folds claude, codex and copilot; `project` narrows claude; `limit` caps each surface, oldest first). Already-landed turns skip, so a re-run catches up. `bulk` reads no `pointer`, `room`, `dry-run` or `writeback`: each refuses by name beside it, since the sweep previews nothing. `sensorium` names the sensorium; absent, memory.

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///sense.capture.pours", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ surface · pointer · bulk · writeback · dry-run · wing · room · project · limit · sensorium · all

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`surface` params=`takes/word ~ the transcript surface (claude, codex, copilot; all with bulk)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pointer` params=`takes/word skins/mcp ~ the transcript to capture`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bulk` params=`~ capture every local transcript in one pass`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`writeback` params=`~ re-enrich a wing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`dry-run` params=`~ preview one pointer's capture`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wing` params=`takes/word ~ the wing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`room` params=`takes/word ~ the room a capture lands in`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`project` params=`takes/word ~ narrow claude to one project`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`limit` params=`takes/count ~ cap each surface's transcripts, oldest first`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium` params=`takes/word skins/mcp ~ the sensorium by name; absent, memory (the terminal names it before the verb: lares sense <sensorium> <verb>)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`all` params=`skins/cli ~ walk the whole tending movement: quiesce, baseline, drawers, bearing, projection, verify, resume`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

